\"main-content\"><div class=\"blog-page-wrap\"><section class=\"blog-hero\" style=\"max-width:900px\"><nav class=\"blog-eyebrow reveal\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/\" class=\"blog-eyebrow-link\">Home</a><span class=\"blog-crumb-sep\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&middot;</span><a href=\"/blog\" class=\"blog-eyebrow-link\">Blog</a><span class=\"blog-crumb-sep\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&middot;</span><span class=\"blog-crumb-current\" aria-current=\"page\">Photography</span></nav><h1 class=\"reveal delay-1\">Photo booth photography: lighting, filters and <span class=\"accent\">film looks</span></h1><p class=\"blog-hero-sub reveal delay-2\">Lighting, camera quality, filters and film aesthetics - the craft side of taking a strip you are happy with.</p></section><nav class=\"blog-filter\" aria-label=\"Browse by category\"><ul class=\"blog-filter-list\"><li><a class=\"blog-filter-chip\" href=\"/blog\">All articles</a></li><li><a class=\"blog-filter-chip\" href=\"/blog/category/guides\">Guides</a></li><li><a class=\"blog-filter-chip\" href=\"/blog/category/ideas\">Ideas</a></li><li><a class=\"blog-filter-chip\" href=\"/blog/category/occasions\">Occasions</a></li><li><a class=\"blog-filter-chip\" href=\"/blog/category/long-distance\">Long Distance</a></li><li><a class=\"blog-filter-chip\" href=\"/blog/category/photography\" aria-current=\"page\">Photography</a></li><li><a class=\"blog-filter-chip\" href=\"/blog/category/culture\">Culture</a></li><li><a class=\"blog-filter-chip\" href=\"/blog/category/studio\">Studio</a></li></ul></nav><h2 class=\"blog-count\">5 articles in Photography &amp; Style</h2>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"blog-index-container\"><div class=\"blog-grid blog-grid-4\"><a href=\"/blog/vintage-film-photo-aesthetic\" class=\"blog-grid-card\" data-category=\"photography\"><div class=\"blog-grid-image\"><picture><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/vintage-film-photo-aesthetic-480.avif?v=8c45d396 480w, /assets/blog/vintage-film-photo-aesthetic-640.avif?v=3d4ab684 640w, /assets/blog/vintage-film-photo-aesthetic-960.avif?v=060d6f47 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/vintage-film-photo-aesthetic-480.webp?v=ca417aec 480w, /assets/blog/vintage-film-photo-aesthetic-640.webp?v=9fdaaf5d 640w, /assets/blog/vintage-film-photo-aesthetic-960.webp?v=fb51cf6d 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><img src=\"/assets/blog/vintage-film-photo-aesthetic-960.webp?v=fb51cf6d\" alt=\"Illustration of a film-look photo strip with grain and warm tones\" width=\"960\" height=\"538\" loading=\"eager\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div><div class=\"blog-grid-content\"><h3>How to Get the Vintage Film Look</h3><p>The six things that actually differ between film and digital, in order of impact - plus a recipe and how to shoot for it.</p><span class=\"blog-read-btn\">Read Article &rarr;</span></div></a><a href=\"/blog/photo-booth-filters-explained\" class=\"blog-grid-card\" data-category=\"photography\"><div class=\"blog-grid-image\"><picture><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/photo-booth-filters-explained-480.avif?v=8840552b 480w, /assets/blog/photo-booth-filters-explained-640.avif?v=74d20f82 640w, /assets/blog/photo-booth-filters-explained-960.avif?v=a59576a3 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/photo-booth-filters-explained-480.webp?v=4666452f 480w, /assets/blog/photo-booth-filters-explained-640.webp?v=8c749c40 640w, /assets/blog/photo-booth-filters-explained-960.webp?v=5d11354d 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><img src=\"/assets/blog/photo-booth-filters-explained-960.webp?v=5d11354d\" alt=\"Illustration comparing photo booth filter styles\" width=\"960\" height=\"538\" loading=\"eager\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div><div class=\"blog-grid-content\"><h3>Photo Booth Filters Explained</h3><p>What each filter family actually does, how to choose by lighting rather than by name, and the strength mistake almost everyone makes.</p><span class=\"blog-read-btn\">Read Article &rarr;</span></div></a><a href=\"/blog/black-and-white-photo-strips\" class=\"blog-grid-card\" data-category=\"photography\"><div class=\"blog-grid-image\"><picture><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/black-and-white-photo-strips-480.avif?v=0a823a99 480w, /assets/blog/black-and-white-photo-strips-640.avif?v=61631d17 640w, /assets/blog/black-and-white-photo-strips-960.avif?v=3ac6127f 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/black-and-white-photo-strips-480.webp?v=e1edc87f 480w, /assets/blog/black-and-white-photo-strips-640.webp?v=a76b3f00 640w, /assets/blog/black-and-white-photo-strips-960.webp?v=bb47623e 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><img src=\"/assets/blog/black-and-white-photo-strips-960.webp?v=bb47623e\" alt=\"Illustration of a black and white photo strip\" width=\"960\" height=\"538\" loading=\"eager\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div><div class=\"blog-grid-content\"><h3>Why Black and White Photo Strips Look So Good</h3><p>Four mechanical reasons monochrome flatters amateur photographs - plus how to shoot for it, and when it loses to colour.</p><span class=\"blog-read-btn\">Read Article &rarr;</span></div></a><a href=\"/blog/webcam-photo-quality-tips\" class=\"blog-grid-card\" data-category=\"photography\"><div class=\"blog-grid-image\"><picture><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/webcam-photo-quality-tips-480.avif?v=fd701349 480w, /assets/blog/webcam-photo-quality-tips-640.avif?v=eaf1d5a0 640w, /assets/blog/webcam-photo-quality-tips-960.avif?v=4406a4f3 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><source type